Package: pdfoxide
Type: Package
Title: Fast PDF Text, Markdown and HTML Extraction (pdf_oxide)
Version: 0.3.68
Authors@R: person("PDF Oxide Contributors", email = "yfedoseev@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Idiomatic R bindings for the pdf_oxide engine, providing fast
    extraction of reading-order text, Markdown and HTML from PDF documents, plus
    building PDFs from Markdown, HTML or text. Wraps the pdf_oxide C ABI.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/yfedoseev/pdf_oxide
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
Suggests: tinytest
